{
  "shape": "schemas-house",
  "name": "schemas_house",
  "recorded_at": "2026-09-02",
  "description": "Fifteen house JSON schemas taken from documents this repo actually emits or consumes (lens 08 section 2.2, JSONSchemaBench's 'benchmark on your own schemas'): .agents/agents.json MCP server rows, .agents/models.json endpoint / model / cost rows, .agents/routing-policy.json classes and PACE plans, .autoresearch/log.tsv rows as JSON, tools/fanout-schema result and lint-rejection shapes, the inference-hub chat result and error envelope, the OpenAI tool_call wire object, an extract-json grunt task and a capability-probe record. Each entry carries one instance that validates and one that must not, so graders.tool_fidelity.schema_errors is exercised in both states.",
  "schemas": [
    {
